  "summary": "整篇形式证明尚未通过 Lean Kernel；请查看原稿锚点、编译诊断和翻译缺口，不能据此判定原数学证明错误。",
  "sourceSteps": [
    {
      "id": "source-0",
      "index": 0,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 145,
      "end": 181,
      "sourceExcerpt": "设翻牌顺序是 a₁,a₂,…,a_n，它们恰为 1,…,n 的一个排列。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_0",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-1",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 181,
      "end": 204,
      "sourceExcerpt": "令 y₀=x，y_j=a_j-y_{j-1}。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_1",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-2",
      "index": 2,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 204,
      "end": 267,
      "sourceExcerpt": "通过对 j 归纳展开，有\ny_n=(-1)^n x + a_n-a_{n-1}+a_{n-2}-⋯+(-1)^{n-1}a₁。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_2",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-3",
      "index": 3,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 268,
      "end": 336,
      "sourceExcerpt": "若要求对所有整数 x 均有 y_n+x=0，则 x 的系数必须为零，即 (-1)^n+1=0，所以 n 为奇数，并且卡片交错和必须为零。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_3",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-4",
      "index": 4,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 336,
      "end": 403,
      "sourceExcerpt": "交错和为零意味着正号位置的卡片之和等于负号位置的卡片之和，故卡片总和 1+2+⋯+n=n(n+1)/2 为偶数，即 4|n(n+1)。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_4",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-5",
      "index": 5,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 403,
      "end": 447,
      "sourceExcerpt": "在 n 奇数条件下 n 与 4 互素，因此 4|(n+1)，即 n≡3 (mod 4)。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_5",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-6",
      "index": 6,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 447,
      "end": 456,
      "sourceExcerpt": "所以这是必要条件。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_6",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-7",
      "index": 7,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 457,
      "end": 463,
      "sourceExcerpt": "再证充分性。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_7",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-8",
      "index": 8,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 463,
      "end": 500,
      "sourceExcerpt": "n=3 时按 1,3,2 的顺序，终值为 2-3+1-x=-x，满足要求。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_8",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-9",
      "index": 9,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 500,
      "end": 524,
      "sourceExcerpt": "假设某个奇数 m 的一组排列已使终值恒为 -x。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_9",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-10",
      "index": 10,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 524,
      "end": 558,
      "sourceExcerpt": "把 m+1、m+2、m+4、m+3 四张新卡片依次接在这组排列末尾。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_10",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-11",
      "index": 11,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 558,
      "end": 641,
      "sourceExcerpt": "经过四次更新，旧终值的系数恢复为 +1，新增常数为 (m+3)-(m+4)+(m+2)-(m+1)=0，因此扩展后终值仍然等于 -x，所有 m+4 张牌恰好使用一次。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_11",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-12",
      "index": 12,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 641,
      "end": 680,
      "sourceExcerpt": "由 m=3 起反复加4的归纳，所有 n=4k+3 (k≥0) 都存在合适排列。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_12",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-13",
      "index": 13,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 681,
      "end": 712,
      "sourceExcerpt": "故可行的自然数 n 恰好是 n≡3 (mod 4) 的正整数。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_13",
      "dependsOn": []
    }
  ],
